{'symbol': 'EMR', 'date': '2019-11-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'EMERSON NAMES MARK BLINN AS INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR', 'text': 'EMERSON ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED MARK BLINN, THE FORMER PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF FLOWSERVE CORPORATION, AS AN INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR. BLINN HAS MORE THAN 20 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE OPERATING MULTI-INDUSTRIAL BUSINESSES IN SENIOR EXECUTIVE ROLES, AS WELL AS SIGNIFICANT LEGAL EXPERTISE AND BOARD EXPERIENCE, INCLUDING AS A LEAD INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR AND AUDIT COMMITTEE CHAIR.'}